      {
        "text": "# Pure Function\n\nA **pure function** is a function that always returns the same output for the same input and does not change anything outside itself (like its parameters or global variables). It just computes and returns a result.\n\nIn other words, when a **pure function** runs, the original array within it, never changes. The function only returns a *new* value.",
